        "description": "Historical OHLCV candle data for a HIP-4 outcome side, aggregated from archived HIP-4 trade data. Coverage begins 2026-05-02 (HIP-4 mainnet launch).\n\n**Note on HIP-4 prices:** HIP-4 prices are implied probabilities (0..1), not USD. `quote_volume` is denominated in USDH (the collateral). The OHLCV shape is identical to perp candles so SDKs work unchanged.\n\n**Available Intervals:** 1m, 5m, 15m, 30m, 1h, 4h, 1d, 1w\n\n**Pagination:** Use the `cursor` parameter with the value from the previous response's `next_cursor`.",
        "operationId": "getHip4Candles",
